@realized-by:ARCH-application @realized-by:ARCH-reports @realized-by:ARCH-mcp
Feature: Ask by recipe

  Agents ask the same questions every session and write each as a query again. A recipe is such a
  question written once, named for the job it answers, with its subject as a parameter.

  Rule: sdp lists its recipes by the job each answers

  Rule: An agent holding changed files gets the specs, rules and decisions in reach of them in one call

  @quality
  Rule: An answer fits one tool call, under 8,000 characters, and names what it left out
